        {
          "text": " Akampitisha mwanawe motoni, akatazama bao, akafanya uganga, akajishughulisha na hao wenye pepo wa utambuzi, na wachawi; akafanya mabaya mengi machoni pa BWANA, hata kumkasirisha. ",
